xcellent visibility.":"極佳的能見度。","Waning Crescent":"殘月","Last Quarter":"下弦月","ESE":"歐洲經濟環境局","Waxing Gibbous":"盈凸月","Full Moon":"滿月","E":"乙","WSW":"西西南","NE":"東北","Center on location":"置中顯示位置","Data sources":"資料來源","Forecast time":"預報時間","Loading wind forecast…":"正在載入風力預報…","Map layers":"地圖圖層","Now":"現在","Open wind map":"開啟風力地圖","Pause":"暫停","Play":"播放","Retry":"重試","The arrows move in the direction the wind travels. The direction label shows where the wind comes from.":"線條沿著風的流動方向移動。風向標籤表示風從哪個方向吹來。","Wind Map":"風力地圖","Wind Speed":"風速","Wind between forecast locations is estimated. Local conditions can differ, especially near mountains and coasts.":"預報地點之間的風況為估算值。當地實際情況可能不同，尤其是在山區和海岸附近。","Wind data unavailable":"無法取得風力資料","Your Locations":"你的地點","Map Data":"地圖資料","Weather data provided by Apple has been modified to create forecast maps.":"已處理Apple提供的天氣資料，以製作預報地圖。","cardinal.N":"氮","cardinal.NNE":"北北東","cardinal.NE":"東北","cardinal.ENE":"埃尼","cardinal.E":"乙","cardinal.ESE":"歐洲經濟環境局","cardinal.SE":"東南歐","cardinal.SSE":"上證所","cardinal.S":"S","cardinal.SSW":"SSW","cardinal.SW":"SW","cardinal.WSW":"西西南","cardinal.W":"瓦","cardinal.WNW":"西西北","cardinal.NW":"西北","cardinal.NNW":"西北西北","Temperature":"溫度","%@'s chance: %d%%":"%@的機會：%d%%","About Feels Like Temperature":"關於體感溫度","About Wind Speed and Gusts":"關於風速和陣風","About the Beaufort Scale":"關於蒲福氏量表","The dew point is what the temperature would need to fall to for dew to form. It can be a useful way to tell how humid the air feels — the higher the dew point, the more humid it feels. A dew point that matches the current temperature means the relative humidity is 100%, and there may be dew or fog.":"露點是溫度需要降到什麼程度才能形成露水。這是一種了解空氣濕度的有用方法——露點越高，感覺越潮濕。露點與目前溫度相匹配，表示相對濕度為100%，可能有露水或霧氣。","About Dew Point":"關於露點","Relative humidity, commonly known just as humidity, is the amount of moisture in the air compared with what the air can hold. The air can hold more moisture at higher temperatures. A relative humidity near 100% means there may be dew or fog.":"相對濕度，通常稱為濕度，是指空氣中的水分含量與空氣所能容納的水分含量之比。空氣在較高溫度下可以容納更多水分。相對濕度接近 100% 意味著可能有露水或霧氣。","About Relative Humidity":"關於相對濕度","Intensity is calculated based on how much rain or snow falls per hour and is meant to indicate how heavy the rain or snow will feel. It is also used with other precipitation types such as sleet and wintry mix. A downpour or heavy snowstorm can have a \"heavy\" intensity, while an average rainfall or lighter drizzle can have a \"moderate\" or \"light\" intensity.":"強度是根據每小時的降雨量或降雪量計算，用來表示雨雪的猛烈程度。它也適用於雨夾雪和冬季混合降水等其他降水類型。傾盆大雨或強烈暴風雪的強度可能為「強」，而一般降雨或較小的毛毛雨的強度可能為「中等」或「弱」。","About Precipitation Intensity":"關於降水強度","Significant, rapid changes in pressure are used to predict changes in the weather. For example, a drop in pressure can mean that rain or snow is on the way, and rising pressure can mean that weather will improve. Pressure is also called barometric pressure or atmospheric pressure.":"顯著、快速的壓力變化可用於預測天氣變化。例如，氣壓下降可能意味著雨或雪即將來臨，而氣壓上升可能意味著天氣將會好轉。壓力也稱為大氣壓力或大氣壓力。","About Pressure":"關於壓力","Visibility tells you how far away you can clearly see objects like buildings and hills. It is a measure of the transparency of the air and does not take into account the amount of sunlight or the presence of obstructions. Visibility at or above %@ is considered clear.":"能見度告訴您可以清楚地看到建築物和山丘等物體的距離有多遠。它是空氣透明度的衡量標準，不考慮陽光的量或障礙物的存在。能見度等於或高於 %@ 時被視為晴朗。","About Visibility":"關於可見性","Actual":"實際","Calm":"冷靜","Light air":"輕空氣","Storm":"風暴","Violent storm":"猛烈風暴","Hurricane-force":"颶風力","Light breeze":"微風","Gentle breeze":"微風徐徐","Moderate breeze":"微風","Fresh breeze":"清新的微風","Strong breeze":"強風","High wind":"大風","Gale":"大風","Strong gale":"強風","Description":"描述","Beaufort Scale":"蒲福氏量級","Chance of Precipitation":"降水機會","Clear":"無雲","Foggy":"有霧","Hazy":"朦朧","Conditions":"條件","%d° now with %@ conditions. There is a precipitation chance of %@. Wind from %@ with gusts up to %d %@. Today's temperature ranges from %d° to %d° and feels like %d°. %@, and %@.":"%d° 現在有 %@ 條件。有%@降水的機會。風速%@，陣風可達%d%@。今天的氣溫範圍是%d°到%d°，感覺像是%d°。 %@和%@。","Daily Summary":"每日總結","The daily chance of precipitation tends to be higher than the chance for each hour.":"每日降水的機會往往高於每小時降水的機會。","The dew point is %d° to %d°.":"露點為%d°至%d°。","The dew point will be %d° to %d°.":"露點將為 %d° 至 %d°。","Feels Like conveys how warm or cold it feels and can be different from the actual temperature. The Feels Like temperature is affected by humidity, sunlight and wind.":"體感溫度表示實際感覺有多熱或多冷，可能與實際氣溫不同。它會受到濕度、陽光和風的影響。","On %@, the average humidity will be %d%%.\n%@":"在%@，平均濕度為%d%%。\n%@","Today, the average humidity is %d%%. %@":"今天，平均濕度為%d%%。 %@","On %@, the total precipitation will be %.1f%@.":"%@，總降水量為%.1f%@。","On %@, the lowest visibility will be %@ at %d %@, and the highest will be %@ at %d %@.":"%@，最低能見度為%@，%d%@，最高能見度為%@，%d%@。","Today, the visibility will be %@, at %d to %d %@.":"今天，能見度為%@，%d至%d%@。","H: %d°":"最高：%d°","Humidity around %d%%":"濕度%d%%左右","Humidity Avg %d%%":"平均濕度 %d%%","Humidity %d%%":"濕度%d%%","Today's min %d%% – max %d%%":"今天的最小值%d%% – 最大值%d%%","LAST 24 HOURS":"過去 24 小時","L: %d°":"最低：%d°","NEXT 24 HOURS":"未來 24 小時","No hourly data available for this day.":"這一天沒有可用的每小時資料。","%@'s low is %d° and the high is %d°. The temperature will feel like %d° to %d°. Wind from %@ is expected. %@":"%@ 的最低值是%d°，最高值是%d°。感覺溫度為 %d° 至 %d°。預計%@有風。 %@","Hourly bars for rain & snow (%@).":"每小時雨雪時段 (%@)。","Heavy":"重型","Precipitation: 0%@":"降水量：0%@","Rain: %.1f%@":"雨：%.1f%@","Rain: %.1f%@, Snow: %.1f%@":"雨：%.1f%@，雪：%.1f%@","Precipitation Totals":"總降水量","On %@, the average pressure will be %@ %@, and the lowest pressure will be %@ %@.":"在%@，平均壓力為%@%@，最低壓力為%@%@。","Pressure Average %@ %@":"平均壓力 %@ %@","Pressure %@ %@":"壓力 %@ %@","Daily range: %@–%@ %@":"每日範圍：%@–%@ %@","Rain":"下雨","Snow":"下雪","The Beaufort wind scale expresses how forceful or strong the wind is at a given speed. The Beaufort scale may make it easier to understand how windy it will feel or how much effect the wind could have. Each value on th